  "title": "Vegan Melanzane (Eggplant) Pasta Sauce",
  "description": "Upgrade your pasta with this vegan eggplant sauce made with a rich blend of garlic, canned whole tomatoes, deep-fried eggplant, and Kalamata olives.",
  "authors": [
